2026-09-17 12:01:07,376 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=adjudication data={"argument_id": "f0ba7095-1988-4594-96e3-1f06422895dd", "created_at": "2026-09-17T10:01:06.970708", "failure_effects": ["C kan inte acceptera V:s budgetvillkorade inflytandemekanism, vilket undergr\u00e4ver paketets trov\u00e4rdighet som statsministerunderlag.", "Regleringsfr\u00e5gan f\u00f6rblir ol\u00f6st; S:s presentation har f\u00f6rtydligat st\u00e5ndpunkterna men inte \u00f6verbryggat konflikten mellan V:s krav p\u00e5 starkt inflytande och C:s krav p\u00e5 en trov\u00e4rdig finanspolitik.", "F\u00f6rhandlingarna forts\u00e4tter utan ett accepterat helhetspaket, och S:s budskap riskerar att betraktas som ett of\u00e4rdigt f\u00f6rsta utkast."], "mode": "probabilistic", "probability": 0.4, "rationale": "S can present the package and bind itself to the policy commitments, so the self-binding parts are automatic. However, the Desired Effect requires V, MP, and C to tolerate the government and support the budget path. These are external, uncertain consequences. The proposal is well-tailored to V's and MP's stated conditions (budget-conditioned influence for V, concrete climate commitments for MP), but C's explicit con highlights a fundamental tension: V's budget veto undermines the credible fiscal framework C requires. Since C's tolerance is the critical sticking point and the con directly challenges the package's stability, the probability of the full Desired Effect being realized is low but not negligible.", "raw_output": {"failure_effects": ["C kan inte acceptera V:s budgetvillkorade inflytandemekanism, vilket undergr\u00e4ver paketets trov\u00e4rdighet som statsministerunderlag.", "Regleringsfr\u00e5gan f\u00f6rblir ol\u00f6st; S:s presentation har f\u00f6rtydligat st\u00e5ndpunkterna men inte \u00f6verbryggat konflikten mellan V:s krav p\u00e5 starkt inflytande och C:s krav p\u00e5 en trov\u00e4rdig finanspolitik.", "F\u00f6rhandlingarna forts\u00e4tter utan ett accepterat helhetspaket, och S:s budskap riskerar att betraktas som ett of\u00e4rdigt f\u00f6rsta utkast."], "failure_supersedes_effect_ids": [], "mode": "probabilistic", "probability": 0.4, "rationale": "S can present the package and bind itself to the policy commitments, so the self-binding parts are automatic. However, the Desired Effect requires V, MP, and C to tolerate the government and support the budget path. These are external, uncertain consequences. The proposal is well-tailored to V's and MP's stated conditions (budget-conditioned influence for V, concrete climate commitments for MP), but C's explicit con highlights a fundamental tension: V's budget veto undermines the credible fiscal framework C requires. Since C's tolerance is the critical sticking point and the con directly challenges the package's stability, the probability of the full Desired Effect being realized is low but not negligible.", "success_effects": ["S-led minoritetsregering etableras som ett trov\u00e4rdigt regeringsalternativ med S som enda regeringsparti, tolererad av V, MP och C.", "Bindande sakpolitiska avtal med V (v\u00e4lf\u00e4rd, bostad, j\u00e4mlikhet, begr\u00e4nsad vinstverksamhet), MP (klimat) och C (f\u00f6retagande, decentralisering, trov\u00e4rdigt finanspolitiskt ramverk) \u00e4r p\u00e5 plats.", "Budgetv\u00e4gen S+V+MP+C (176 mandat) framst\u00e5r som den f\u00f6rv\u00e4ntade r\u00f6stningen f\u00f6r den f\u00f6rsta budgeten."], "success_supersedes_effect_ids": []}, "roll": 0.34541455840024304, "success": true, "success_effects": ["S-led minoritetsregering etableras som ett trov\u00e4rdigt regeringsalternativ med S som enda regeringsparti, tolererad av V, MP och C.", "Bindande sakpolitiska avtal med V (v\u00e4lf\u00e4rd, bostad, j\u00e4mlikhet, begr\u00e4nsad vinstverksamhet), MP (klimat) och C (f\u00f6retagande, decentralisering, trov\u00e4rdigt finanspolitiskt ramverk) \u00e4r p\u00e5 plats.", "Budgetv\u00e4gen S+V+MP+C (176 mandat) framst\u00e5r som den f\u00f6rv\u00e4ntad