2026-09-17 12:44:04,029 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T10:44:03.684386", "id": "37305465-8a76-4a88-a4e1-9ac5cc2528d2", "public": false, "recipients": ["s"], "sender_actor_id": "kd", "text": "Socialdemokraterna \u2014 KD \u00e4r redo att ta ansvar i en bred, SD-fri mittenregering: S+C+KD+MP, med m\u00f6jlighet att inkludera L. KD deltar som regeringsparti med tydligt inflytande, och V h\u00e5lls utanf\u00f6r regeringen. Vi erbjuder konkret sakpolitik: v\u00e4lf\u00e4rd och familjepolitik, f\u00f6retagande och decentralisering, samt ett trov\u00e4rdigt finanspolitiskt ramverk. Vi vill s\u00e4kra en robust budgetv\u00e4g och L:s avst\u00e5ende/deltagande f\u00f6r att klara 175-nej-testet. \u00c4r ni beredda att f\u00f6rhandla detta?", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 12:44:04,030 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T10:44:03.703561", "id": "cb38fea0-0f7c-4a16-87c4-1dc862d6a6ed", "public": false, "recipients": ["c"], "sender_actor_id": "kd", "text": "Centerpartiet \u2014 KD st\u00e5r fast vid mittenalternativet S-C-KD-MP och delar er r\u00f6da linje mot V i regering. Vi \u00e4r beredda att g\u00e5 in i en mittenregering med tydligt reforminneh\u00e5ll kring f\u00f6retagande, decentralisering och ett trov\u00e4rdigt finanspolitiskt ramverk. L\u00e5t oss samordna oss med S och testa L:s h\u00e5llning f\u00f6r att s\u00e4kra 175-nej-testet.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 12:44:04,030 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T10:44:03.717195", "id": "8987a2dd-982a-4fc0-9980-4df1e7b2068a", "public": false, "recipients": ["l"], "sender_actor_id": "kd", "text": "Liberalerna \u2014 Tid\u00f6alternativet har kollapsat (C har dragit tillbaka toleransen). F\u00f6r att undvika en l\u00e5ngvarig l\u00e5sning och en S-minoritetsregering d\u00e4r V f\u00e5r dominerande inflytande, \u00f6verv\u00e4g att avst\u00e5 eller delta i en mittenregering S+C+KD+MP. Vi kan s\u00e4kra tydliga skolpolitiska vinster och liberala reformer. Ert avst\u00e5ende/deltagande \u00e4r avg\u00f6rande f\u00f6r att klara 175-nej-testet. Kan vi diskutera detta?", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 12:44:04,030 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T10:44:03.731978", "id": "0784eb66-2afd-405f-9168-aab2c3e9e850", "public": false, "recipients": ["v"], "sender_actor_id": "kd", "text": "V\u00e4nsterpartiet \u2014 KD \u00e4r \u00f6ppet f\u00f6r en bred, SD-fri l\u00f6sning, men v\u00e5r r\u00f6da linje \u00e4r att V inte ing\u00e5r i regeringen. Vi vill inte blockera ert sakpolitiska inflytande utanf\u00f6r regeringen, men en mittenregering med KD i regeringen kr\u00e4ver att V avst\u00e5r fr\u00e5n att f\u00e4lla den. Kan vi hitta en konstruktiv v\u00e4g?", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 12:44:04,030 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "KD formally proposes and commits to a block-crossing mitten government S+C+KD+MP (possibly +L), with KD as a full government party, V\u00e4nsterpartiet kept out of government, and concrete policy content (welfare and family policy, enterprise and decentralization, credible fiscal framework). KD offers its participation and seeks L's abstention/participation to secure a robust 175-nej-test.", "actor_id": "kd", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": ["mp", "l"], "desired_effect": "A credible mitten government alternative is established that includes KD in government with clear influence, keeps V out of government, and has a robust budget path (S+C+KD+MP=169, robust against V's NEJ if L abstains/joins), giving KD kingmaker leverage and a functioning package.", "id": "52a1f7a1-e9f0-440b-91cc-59c9cacf1f9f", "pros": ["Tid\u00f6 is non-viable (C withdrew tolerance; M-alternative collapsed), so per KD's brief the cross-bloc reserve is the defensible path after serious negotiations.", "Keeps V out of government, honoring KD's red line.", "Puts KD in government with clear policy influence, fulfilling the kingmaker objective.", "Mathematically robust: with L abstaining/joining, the mitten government survives the 175-nej-test even if V votes NEJ (NEJ from M+SD=132, +V=161<175).", "Aligns with C's mitten proposal and S's openness to a broad SD-free solution."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
