2026-09-17 13:07:23,579 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T11:07:22.300448", "id": "289f1612-9312-40c4-9e00-b32f520c2ac4", "public": false, "recipients": ["l"], "sender_actor_id": "s", "text": "L, h\u00e4r \u00e4r hela paketet f\u00f6r er slutliga bed\u00f6mning. Regeringen blir en S-ledd minoritetsregering med S som enda regeringsparti, tolererad av V, MP och C (alla bekr\u00e4ftade att de inte r\u00f6star NEJ). Skolreformerna skrivs in som verifierbara \u00e5taganden: l\u00e4rarkvalitet (fler legitimerade l\u00e4rare, tydliga karri\u00e4rv\u00e4gar), studiero (st\u00e4rkta befogenheter f\u00f6r l\u00e4rare att uppr\u00e4tth\u00e5lla ordning) och l\u00e4sf\u00f6rm\u00e5ga (tidiga insatser, nationell l\u00e4ssatsning). Vi bekr\u00e4ftar en liberal r\u00e4ttsstats- och ekonomisk linje. Budgetv\u00e4gen \u00e4r S+V+MP+C=176 mandat med en gemensam, trov\u00e4rdig finanspolitisk ram som h\u00e5ller ramverket intakt. V:s inflytande avgr\u00e4nsas strikt till V:s \u00f6verenskomna politikomr\u00e5den via tolerans och sakavtal \u2014 ingen regeringsplats, ingen dominans. Med detta p\u00e5 plats ber vi er bekr\u00e4fta er icke-blockerande h\u00e5llning (att ni inte r\u00f6star NEJ) vid statsministeromr\u00f6stningen.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 13:07:23,579 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T11:07:22.345772", "id": "bc5fb25d-a4b0-4693-8291-f8822ac3fa77", "public": false, "recipients": ["kd"], "sender_actor_id": "s", "text": "KD, vi uppskattar er konstruktiva h\u00e5llning och att ni inte blockerar statsministeromr\u00f6stningen. Regeringen blir en S-ledd minoritetsregering med V och SD utanf\u00f6r regeringen, vilket uppfyller er r\u00f6da linje. F\u00f6r att h\u00e5lla paketet smalt och sammanh\u00e5llet h\u00e5ller vi k\u00e4rnan kring C, V och MP. Vi \u00e4r \u00f6ppna f\u00f6r att beakta era sakprioriteringar (familje- och v\u00e4lf\u00e4rdspolitik, f\u00f6retagande, decentralisering, trov\u00e4rdigt finanspolitiskt ramverk) i den m\u00e5n de \u00e4r f\u00f6renliga med paketet, men kan inte lova en bred flerpartiuppg\u00f6relse. V f\u00e5r inga regeringsplatser och dess inflytande avgr\u00e4nsas. Vi v\u00e4lkomnar ert icke-blockerande st\u00f6d.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 13:07:23,580 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Present the consolidated S-led minority government package to the Speaker (talman) as a complete, credible proposal: S as sole government party, tolerated by V, MP and C (all confirmed not voting NEJ), with L abstaining (not NEJ), and a credible budget path S+V+MP+C=176 with a shared fiscal framework and binding verifiable reform agreements (V: welfare/housing/equality/reduced profit-seeking; MP: climate; C: enterprise/decentralisation/fiscal framework; L: school reforms).", "actor_id": "s", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": ["v", "kd"], "desired_effect": "The S-led minority government is established and confirmed as the only credible, viable government alternative, passing the 175-NEJ test (Tid\u00f6=173 NEJ, C does not vote NEJ) with a credible budget path, so the Speaker nominates the S-led candidate and the government is formed.", "id": "a1965cc6-226d-4be9-bf96-746b82540487", "pros": ["C, V and MP have all explicitly confirmed tolerance (not voting NEJ) and budget support, giving a confirmed 176-mandate budget path and a PM vote that cannot reach 175 NEJ.", "Tid\u00f6 (M+KD+L+SD=173) is insufficient to reject an S-led candidate, and C's confirmed non-NEJ position makes the S-led path the only viable alternative.", "L's signalled abstention (not NEJ) adds insurance to the PM vote, and its school-reform demands are met with verifiable commitments in the package.", "The package is narrow and coherent (core C/V/MP), keeping V and SD out of government to satisfy C's red line while giving V and MP real, binding influence via tolerance.", "A credible budget path (S+V+MP+C=176) with a shared fiscal framework and verifiable reform agreements satisfies the requirement of budgetm\u00e4ssig regeringsduglighet."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 2}
